Third-party material
--------------------

Part of the German vocabulary in this dictionary was gathered from the German
quest text in the quest database of Questie
(https://github.com/Questie/Questie), which is distributed under the GNU
General Public License version 3.

Modifications made by Ironship, 30 August 2026:

  * German quest titles and objective lines for Classic Era were read for the
    words they contain. Roughly 3,900 words that the dictionary did not
    already cover were taken from them.
  * What this addon ships is not that text. It is a list of individual German
    words, each with an English translation and an explanatory note written
    for this project. No quest sentence is reproduced.
  * The remaining ~74,000 entries were built from Blizzard's own Game Data API
    and are unaffected.

The extraction is performed by Tools/extract_classic_words.py, which is part of
the corresponding source of this work.

